el"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","cs.LG"],"summary":"该论文利用JWST深度成像的弱引力透镜数据，结合物理前向模型与基于宇宙学模拟训练的扩散模型贝叶斯先验，在COSMOS-Web场中重建了至z≈2的三维暗物质分布后验，实现了高红移、非高斯区间的概率化宇宙网制图。","date":"2026-11-04","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.03786","score":78,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2611.05487","canonical_id":"2611.05487","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A pocket of oxygen in a near-pristine galaxy at z=4.2: chemical inhomogeneity at 10-parsec scales in LAP2","authors":["M. Messa","E. Vanzella","S. Rojas-Ruiz","T. Treu","P. Bergamini","G. Di Rosa","M. Lombardi","P. Rosati","A. Zanella","A. Adamo","A. Bolamperti","F. Calura","M. Castellano","R. Gilli","C. Grillo","U. Meštrić"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用JWST/NIRSpec积分视场光谱观测强透镜星系LAP2（z=4.2），测得极贫金属丰度（≤0.5% Z⊙，核心~1% Z⊙）、无尘、年轻（≲10 Myr）的星暴，其恒星质量仅~10^5 M⊙，把光谱证认的极贫金属星系普查扩展到星团质量与M_UV≈-13的区间。","date":"2026-11-05","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05487","score":68,"stars":3,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"stellar physics","points":-32}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2610.41584","canonical_id":"2610.41584","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Co-evolution of AGN and Host Galaxies across Cosmic Time Using JWST data","authors":["Priyanka Jalan","Tomotsugu Goto","Tetsuya Hashimoto","Angel Rodriguez Barbosa","Chih-Teng Ling","Ece Kilerci","Terry Long Phan","Srivardini Ayyappan"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"基于SMILES与JADES交叉匹配的2,709个源的JWST多波段星表（0.05<z<6），用Pearson相关矩阵与主成分分析发现星系多样性由\"AGN与星系活动\"和\"恒星年龄\"两个主成分主导；AGN光度主要由宿主星系当前冷气体供给驱动，近期恒星形成是其主要观测示踪。","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.41584","score":48,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2610.41493","canonical_id":"2610.41493","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"As a matter of reconstruction -- varying the magnetic Prandtl number in implicit large eddy simulations","authors":["Vinay Kumar","Philipp Grete"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.HE","astro-ph.SR","physics.flu-dyn","physics.plasm-ph"],"summary":"在有限体积隐式大涡模拟(ILES)中，通过对流体变量与磁场变量采用不同阶数的重构方案，可在不引入显式耗散的情况下把有效磁Prandtl数(Pm)改变约20倍以上。","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.41493","score":33,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2611.03802","canonical_id":"2611.03802","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A full chemical network treatment of supermassive black hole seed formation from dark matter annihilation or decay","authors":["Han Wu","Sarah Schon","Aaron C. Vincent"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO","hep-ph"],"summary":"本文探讨质量低于~200 eV的暗物质（衰变或湮灭）能否提供足够的紫外辐射，从宇宙学背景和早期暗物质晕内部两个层面光解氢分子、抑制碎裂，从而促成原初无尘无金属气体云在z~20直接坍缩形成超大质量黑洞种子。","date":"2026-11-04","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.03802","score":32,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2610.41842","canonical_id":"2610.41842","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The multiple origins of spurs in stellar streams: a challenge for dark matter diagnostics","authors":["Claire Guillaume","Alicia Rivero","Titouan Le Guillois","Florent Renaud","Guillaume F. Thomas","Nicolas F. Martin"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"恒星流上的刺状结构（spurs）常被当作暗物质子晕相互作用的证据，但本文通过模拟指出，银河系重子成分（棒、星系并合）同样能产生形态相似的刺状结构，因此不应单凭形态推断其成因或限制暗物质性质。","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.41842","score":32,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2611.05496","canonical_id":"2611.05496","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"ReveaLLAGN 2: Exploring the Nuclear Gas and Stellar Kinematics of Nearby LLAGNs with JWST/NIRSpec IFU","authors":["Antoine Dumont","Nadine Neumayer","Anil C. Seth","Torsten Böker","Jonelle L. Walsh","Micheal Eracleous","Luis C. Ho","Kameron Goold","David Ohlson","Timothy A. Davis"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用JWST/NIRSpec对ReveaLLAGN样本中8个近邻低光度活动星系核的核区进行空间分辨运动学分析，揭示恒星慢旋转盘、气体与恒星解耦旋转、喷流相关的气体运动以及Eddington比依赖的谱线可探测性。","date":"2026-11-05","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05496","score":22,"stars":1,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"high-redshift galaxy dynamics","points":34}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["High-redshift Galaxy Dynamics"]},{"id":"2610.40788","canonical_id":"2610.40788","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"How to feed your dragon: the role of turbulence in AGN activity","authors":["Olga Borodina","Jake S. Bennett","Yueying Ni","Rainer Weinberger","Michaela Hirschmann","Boon Kiat Oh","Lars Hernquist"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用含吸积黑洞的湍流盒模拟，发现湍流星际介质是喷流发射与传播的关键，且存在依赖马赫数的临界喷流效率因子，超过后系统进入自限吸积状态。","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.40788","score":22,"stars":1,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2611.06872","canonical_id":"2611.06872","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Magnetohydrodynamics During Reheating","authors":["Sovan Sau","Subhasis Maiti","Sahel Dey","Alberto Roper Pol","Debaprasad Maity"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文建立多流体框架，研究非瞬时重加热阶段三维非线性磁流体力学的演化，发现均匀能量转移显著提升辐射与动能密度但不明显放大初始磁场扰动，磁谱基本不变，而速度扰动发生尺度再分配并改变引力波谱。","date":"2026-11-05","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.06872","score":18,"stars":1,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]}],"must_read":[{"id":"2611.06667",